{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And Amram took.</b> Midrash: because Moses was born from a father's sister, therefore כרת (excision) is not written regarding ערות דודתו, on account of his honor. And this is what the liturgical poet established in the azharot of חוקה: ״אחות אב על כל נעלם תכסך בושה ונכרת לעולם״."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:02:46.150200695Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}